[
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/0",
      "value": "Skath 'history' as we know it goes back only two to three hundred years, at which point it becomes a very different tale...one of sorrow and misery, slavery and death. You see, close to the time they began interstellar exploration the Skath were anxious to meet others in their galactic neighborhood."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/0",
      "value": "スカース「歴史」は、わずか二〇〇年から三〇〇年前に遡り、その時点では、悲しみと悲しみ、奴隷制と死の物語とは全く異なる物語になっています。 彼らが星間探索を始めた頃、スカースは銀河系の近所で他の人に会うことを切望していました。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/1",
      "value": "This eagerness would prove folly, for the nearest species to them (whom they refer to as Volarian, though no record of this species exists in current records) was of a hostile sort and saw only a new food source in the Skath people. And feed they did, with the help of their terrible machines."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/1",
      "value": "彼らにとって最も近い種(彼らはVolarianと呼ばれていますが、現在の記録にはこの種の記録はありません)は敵対的な種類のものであり、スカースの人々にとって新たな食料源のみを見ました。 そして、彼らは彼らのひどい機械の助けを借りて、彼らがしたフィード。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/2",
      "value": "Unable to compete technologically with the hostile invaders, the Skath ceased all resistance activity within six to nine months (records are spotty on this detail) and simply accepted their fate. And for almost two hundred years they worked as food and slaves, bred for the enjoyment of their oppressors."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/2",
      "value": "敵対する侵略者と技術的に競争することができなかったため、スカスは六ヶ月から九ヶ月以内に全ての抵抗活動を中断し(記録はこの詳細についてよくわかっている)、単純に彼らの運命を受け入れた。 そして、ほぼ二〇〇年間、彼らは彼らの抑圧者の喜びのために育てられた、食べ物と奴隷として働きました。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/3",
      "value": "Underneath the waves, a different sort of resistance had begun. A large contingent of Skath had retreated into the oceans and seas where the enemy was unable to follow (or unwilling, records do not specify either way). Using stolen technology merged with their own, new methods of resistance were devised. All they needed now was a chance to strike."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/3",
      "value": "波の下で、別の種類の抵抗が始まりました。 スカースの大部分は、敵が従えなかった海や海に後退していた(あるいは、望まなかったが、記録はどちらの方法も特定しなかった)。 盗まれた技術を使って独自の抵抗法が考案された。 今必要なのはストライキのチャンスだけだった。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/4",
      "value": "Eventually, the invaders began to stretch themselves too thin in Skath space, and eventually exposed a weakness. It was at this point that the Skath were able to turn the tide with their new Plasmic weapon technology (reverse engineered from that of the invading forces) and reclaim their freedom."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/4",
      "value": "やがて、侵略軍はスカース空間で自分自身を薄く伸ばし、やがて弱点を露呈した。 この時点で、スカースは新しいプラズミック兵器技術(侵略軍から逆向きに設計された)で潮流を回し、その自由を取り戻せるようになった。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/5",
      "value": "Their stories claim the invaders ran in fear, never to return. Based on their narrative, however, it is surmised that in truth the invaders were themselves eliminated by another force entirely...or are still among us. If my theories are accurate ,the chances are high they were in fact the Ghex; they were recently eaten to extinction by the Xitix-Thelus on the fringes of known space."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/5",
      "value": "彼らの話は侵略者が恐怖の中で走ったと主張し、決して戻らない。 しかし、彼らの話に基づいて、侵略者は実際には別の力によって完全に排除されたか、まだ私たちの中にいると推測されています。 私の理論が正確であれば、彼らは実際にGhexだった可能性が高いです。彼らは最近、既知の空間の縁でXitix-Thelusによって絶滅するために食べられました。"
    }
  ],
  [
